+### Inputs and Outputs
+*   **Inputs**:
+    *   New metadata for a volume region (channel, resolution, spatial bounds).
+    *   New brick data (spatial bounds, resolution level, channel).
+    *   Eviction request (brick to remove).
+*   **Outputs**:
